## Also available: Game Assets (importable files)

These are **file assets** — import with `import_source(file_path="<path>")` inside `edit_by_dsl`.
They are NOT scene objects (not for `add_builtin_object`).

- **Title Bar** (PNG): Dark rounded title bar/header strip
  path: `ui/panels/title_bar.png`  |  tags: title, header, bar, panel, ui
- **Progress Bar Background** (PNG): Gray rounded progress bar background/track
  path: `ui/progress/progress_bg.png`  |  tags: progress, bar, background, track, ui
- **Confirm Button (Normal)** (PNG): Confirm rounded rectangle button — normal state, transparent background
  path: `ui/buttons/btn_green_normal.png`  |  tags: button, green, normal, ui, game

